---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Robert Stickler" lang="en">
	<main class="min-h-screen py-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
			<a href="/en/" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors">
				&larr; Back to homepage
			</a>
			<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-6 mb-10 text-foreground">Privacy Policy</h1>

			<div class="space-y-8 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">1. Controller</h2>
					<p>
						Robert Stickler<br />
						1070 Vienna, Austria<br />
						Email:
						<a href="mailto:rstickler98@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">
							rstickler98@gmail.com
						</a>
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">2. Overview</h2>
					<p>
						This website is a private portfolio. It sets no cookies, uses no
						analytics or tracking services, and processes no data for advertising
						purposes. Fonts are served locally from this website's server; no
						Google Fonts or other third-party CDNs are embedded.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">3. Hosting (Netlify)</h2>
					<p>
						This website is hosted by Netlify, Inc., San Francisco, California, USA.
						When you visit the website, Netlify processes technically necessary
						server log data (IP address, date and time of access, requested page,
						browser identifier) to deliver the website and ensure its security and
						stability. The legal basis is the legitimate interest in the technical
						operation of the website (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Transfers to the USA are
						based on the EU Standard Contractual Clauses (Art. 46 GDPR). More
						information:
						<a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">
							Netlify Privacy Policy</a>.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">4. Contact form</h2>
					<p>
						If you use the contact form, the data you enter (name, email address,
						optional subject, message) is transmitted and stored via Netlify Forms,
						solely to process and respond to your inquiry. The legal basis is the
						performance of pre-contractual measures and the legitimate interest in
						answering your inquiry (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR). The data is deleted
						once your inquiry has been dealt with, at the latest after six months,
						unless statutory retention obligations apply.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">5. Local storage in your browser</h2>
					<p>
						This website stores purely functional settings in your browser's local
						storage and session storage: dark/light mode, the selected color scheme,
						the scroll position when switching languages, and the high score of the
						hidden mini-game. This data remains exclusively in your browser, is
						never transmitted to any server, and is not used for identification or
						analytics. You can delete it at any time via your browser settings.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">6. External links</h2>
					<p>
						This website links to external platforms (LinkedIn, GitHub, Instagram).
						When you follow these links, the privacy policies of the respective
						providers apply.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">7. Your rights</h2>
					<p>
						You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of
						processing, data portability and objection. If you believe that the
						processing of your data violates data protection law, you can lodge a
						complaint with the Austrian Data Protection Authority
						(<a href="https://www.dsb.gv.at" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">www.dsb.gv.at</a>).
						Please direct any requests to the email address stated above.
					</p>
				</section>

				<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground/70">Last updated: July 2026</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
